Django and FastAPI

Django and FastAPI are Python web frameworks used by developers to build custom web applications.

So the full picture is:

| Category                          | Examples                    | Main Use                      |
| --------------------------------- | --------------------------- | ----------------------------- |
| **Website builders / CMS**        | WordPress, Wix, Squarespace | Create websites easily        |
| **E-commerce platforms**          | Shopify                     | Create online stores          |
| **Visual web development**        | Webflow                     | Design professional websites  |
| **Custom development frameworks** | Django, FastAPI             | Build custom web applications |
| **Frontend coding**               | HTML, CSS, JavaScript       | Build website interface       |


==========

Simple example
Want to create a website?
        │
        ├── Without much coding
        │       ↓
        │   WordPress / Wix / Shopify
        │
        └── With custom programming
                ↓
        Django / FastAPI
                +
        HTML / CSS / JavaScript

